[{"key":"1ydgnwz0zjpgtp","text":"To castle: king and rook never moved, the path is empty, and no square is attacked."},{"key":"116670507kw0c5","text":"The bishop lives on light squares, but the star is on a dark square. Never!"},{"key":"1vgma4v0h9p073","text":"The bishop lives on dark squares, but the star is on a dark square. Never!"},{"key":"17shv8r1qguuu9","text":"The king can't move, but nobody attacks him. Stalemate: it's a tie!"},{"key":"1xt450b12bf5jz","text":"Your king is in check! Find every way out: run, block and capture."},{"key":"0ml5wlh0hrqw3f","text":"I captured your king! Good game. Keep your king safe next time!"},{"key":"08zrbh81ygxcfm","text":"The bishop attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"07ojp9n03ad9ot","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the bishop."},{"key":"0656mgu0kspah2","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the queen."},{"key":"0e5f0tu0bd096m","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the pawn."},{"key":"1buegl41sw1tau","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your bishop. Try again!"},{"key":"07ivo9g0me76ok","text":"Ember found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"11myrcb1tvblyj","text":"That one isn't attacking the king. Who can reach him?"},{"key":"1aswiqa1wfyw1e","text":"Her friends are in the way! Where can the queen go?"},{"key":"0xh1s680okd31k","text":"Every move eats a snack. Guarded snacks bite back!"},{"key":"0nzibn51sawidx","text":"Reset this kid's settings to the new age defaults?"},{"key":"19svlty165dr56","text":"Oops, Ember left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0v26n2o1vuqkxy","text":"Oops, Shelly left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1b1bzog0qrp9fu","text":"Oops, Fern left a bishop alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"12557m903go4jd","text":"The bishop gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"1nicepi06q6bpi","text":"Oops, Hop left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1su0ott0citdfz","text":"Oops, Olive left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1jdnuem1uuah34","text":"Oops, Ember left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1oxiw2a12fabou","text":"March the pawn to the end and pick a new piece!"},{"key":"0pmdvzp0t86q9n","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the knight can go."},{"key":"1644osm1d2jyha","text":"Oops, Fern left a king alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"11z3jlh1nt2ua7","text":"The rook gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"1abt8vx0gockwn","text":"Oops, Hop left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0j4cjer02pshq7","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the king can go."},{"key":"0t8krcb0qoyrxd","text":"Pawn 1, knight 3, bishop 3, rook 5, queen 9."},{"key":"1xe96n407qaaho","text":"Olive is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"1be1pi500twsjv","text":"Ember's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"1smyhf80bmi1es","text":"Which of your pieces can reach the cookie?"},{"key":"0ji4cag1lum3ew","text":"Fern is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"14l56l11iw7e8x","text":"Nobody is attacking the king. He is calm!"},{"key":"1nbn1t2030hb4u","text":"Good game! Every game makes you stronger."},{"key":"0fey8ue1h9i32i","text":"Yes! That knight is attacking the king!"},{"key":"14appif1oaxap1","text":"You made a knight with check. Surprise!"},{"key":"08n6jvs07qgb6u","text":"First the letter a, then the number 4."},{"key":"0d84zbc0u81nes","text":"First the letter b, then the number 1."},{"key":"14fbhsj0u81njd","text":"First the letter b, then the number 6."},{"key":"1mjymd11gpmzrb","text":"First the letter c, then the number 3."},{"key":"1m0he2q1gpmzvw","text":"First the letter c, then the number 8."},{"key":"1qgpdve0464a4q","text":"First the letter d, then the number 5."},{"key":"1ss70iy0qnpmco","text":"First the letter e, then the number 2."},{"key":"12pqcf70qnpmh9","text":"First the letter e, then the number 7."},{"key":"1q6i99p1d5ayp7","text":"First the letter f, then the number 4."},{"key":"0bf4f7v00ls8y1","text":"First the letter g, then the nu